{"result":"{
  "id": "18944",
  "key": "SFCC-563",
  "description": "MERGED INTO SFCC-562 as of 2026-09-14 - do not groom this story separately. All requirement detail, acceptance criteria, and technical notes now live on SFCC-562.\n\nOriginal description, retained for reference:\n\nAs a Site Admin, I want canonical tags on all filtered and faceted PLP URLs pointing back to the unfiltered base PLP URL, so that duplicate content from filter/facet parameter combinations does not dilute the authority of the canonical PLP.\n\nPer FR comment: Zimmermann want the ability to control and update the canonical on indexable filter pages via BM where needed. This BM configurability should be scoped into this story. Depends on SFCC-562 (canonical tags on all indexable pages).",
